      "content": "he seems okay otherwise though, just a bit cranky and warm. he's not acting super sick or anything. i really dont want to take him to the er in the middle of the night if it's just a virus or something that's gonna clear up on its own. can i just give him some child ibuprofen and keep an eye on him til morning? do you think it's really that urgent?",
