      "content": "i just called the after hours line but it's just a recording and i can't get a real person. i feel like im overreacting... he's just a little hot and has a few spots. if i just keep the fever down with some advil and maybe give him some extra fluids, what are the actual signs that i should definitely stop waiting and go to the hospital? like, what is the worst case scenario here? i just want to be sure it's not worth the trip.",
